输出缩放后的图像。\n\nmask：如果有mask输入，则输出缩放后的mask。\n\noriginal_size：图片原始大小数据，用于后续节点恢复。\n\n宽度：输出图像的宽度。\n\n高度：输出图像的高度。\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\nImageScaleByAspectRatio V2 升级版\nscale_to_side：允许按长、短、宽、高或总像素的指定尺寸缩放。\nscale_to_length：此处的数值作为指定边的长度或scale_to_side的总像素数（千像素）。\nbackground_color 4：背景的颜色。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [381.8717956542969, 545.4364013671875], "pos": [5659.9892578125, 1095.6710205078125], "id": 57, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [383.0527038574219, 314], "pos": [5195.61865234375, 2124.792724609375], "widgets_values": ["output (18).png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [383.0527038574219, 314], "pos": [5680.005859375, 2272.8837890625], "widgets_values": ["output (17).png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 59, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enable